<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/408801ACHNHMBMMDHLBKDMKGSKBDGPTLR>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "A Celtic Family Christmas Party";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/6fd316ec-ec24-44f7-94e5-0b4bce7f8869.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Kootenay Concert Connection presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">A CELTIC FAMILY CHRISTMAS PARTY</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">with Natalie MacMaster & Donnell Leahy</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Get ready for the brand-new Celtic Family Christmas...PARTY!<span><br/></span>You’ll have plenty of time to sip eggnog by the fire, but not on this night... So buckle up and join Natalie MacMaster & Donnell Leahy, their growing family, and their world-class band as they guide you through an exhilarating exploration of the Christmas season. Featuring exciting new versions of all your classic Christmas favourites, Natalie & Donnell are determined to raise the roof, rejuvenate the heart, and set your spirit ablaze with a most lively Celtic Family Christmas PARTY!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>In the early 2000s, they balanced raising seven musically gifted children, running a farm, and performing over 75 shows a year. Now, with their children in their teens, Natalie and Donnell are back with their electrifying live performances. Natalie, inducted into the Order of Canada in 2006, has won 2 JUNO Awards, 19 East Coast Music Awards, and released 3 Gold Albums. Donnell, known for his incredible stage presence, led the family band “Leahy” to Double-Platinum status, won 3 JUNO Awards, and starred in the Academy Award-winning documentary “The Leahys: Music Most of All”. Together, they’ve sold out over 1000 shows in North America and collaborated with stars like Yo-Yo Ma, Michael McDonald, Allison Krauss, and Nickelback. Despite their busy schedules, Natalie and Donnell remain must-see live performers, continuing their tireless touring.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $70.21</span>  ($59.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.85 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF) and 5% GST. A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">A Celtic Family Christmas Party</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
