<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/400601ADVPCJDVPGNDHSKQJDTKNGCTDRN>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Actually, It Is Rocket Science";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/4fb3c717-4472-4777-b10e-ffe323c1df80.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>TETON GRAVITY RESEARCH presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">ACTUALLY, IT IS ROCKET SCIENCE</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Join Teton Gravity Research for its 31st annual ski and snowboard film, featuring elite athletes, breathtaking cinematography, and the year's biggest mountain adventures. Experience the excitement, community, and stoke of ski season on the big screen.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adult (16 and up) $31.46</span>  ($25.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $4.10 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Youth under 16  $19.99</span>  ($15.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $2.63 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Student w/ID  $19.99</span>  ($15.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $2.63 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">EARLY BIRD DISCOUNT! July 23-24, get your tickets for $10 plus fees!</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre at the Rotary Centre for the Arts event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Actually, It Is Rocket Science</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span><span><br/></span>
""";
