<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/409801ASBRVQVSBHLLKQQTNBCLSKPTGPT>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Ben Thompson as Elvis Birthday Tour 2027";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/513b4071-cfba-4cee-a780-f4eef58f83cf.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>LMS Entertainment presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">BEN THOMPSON AS ELVIS BIRTHDAY TOUR 2027</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">⚡ Tour Announcement </span>⚡<span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>Direct from the UK we are very excited to announce Ultimate Elvis Champion Ben Thompson as Elvis, Live in concert with the Cadillac Kings & Queens Show Band!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>For one night, you get to experience what it would’ve been like to witness The King of Rock ‘n’ Roll live in the flesh. Although no one will ever replace Elvis Presley, The 2018 Ultimate Elvis Tribute Artist Champion has been commended by many who worked with Elvis himself and was even chosen to portray Elvis in the Blockbuster Movie ‘Bladerunner 2049’.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>As an official representative of Elvis Presley Enterprises, Ben stays true to Elvis as he takes you back through all the eras. Opening with the 50’s, you are taken back to where it all began, then to the movies, a quick change into the leathers and its the NBC’s ‘68 Comeback Special, finally closing the show with a replica of the amazing 70s concert years.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>It really is a show created with every Elvis Fan in mind.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $69.92</span>  ($58.75 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.81 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Ben Thompson as Elvis Birthday Tour 2027</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
