			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/d7d1d050-ef05-44fc-b37b-43f4d0eb7330.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Project DIVE Inc. presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">BOLLY GROOVE HOUSE</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">This is a 19+ event!</span></span> <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Bolly Groove House is a place for Bollywood / Indian / UK / Punjabi music with tech and house. It brings Asian, UK Punjabi tunes  and groovy house / tech music together in one place to make it feel like a complete experience ! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Please note outside food and alcohol is not allowed. <span><br/></span>Cash bar on site.<span><br/></span>19+ event <span><br/></span>Please carry government issued valid ID for entry. <span><br/></span>No re-entry<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">August 11 - August 20  $28.74</span>  ($24.99 base price + $3.75 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">August 21 - August 29  $34.49</span>  ($29.99 base price + $4.50 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">August 30 - September 18  $40.24</span>  ($34.99 base price + $5.25 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Door price $45.99</span>  ($39.99 base price + $6.00 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Bolly Groove House</span> tickets and service fees are non-refundable.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>
""";
