<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/410401ADMSLMHPMHSNHDPLPCPQRGDVJQL>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Built For More - Business Growth Summit";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/295e2d9a-4d7c-4a13-871b-0521dedda9b3.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>The Boss Network Ltd. presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">BUILT FOR MORE</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Business Growth Summit</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">This is a 19+ only event!</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>An afternoon for entrepreneurs who are ready to grow their business, strengthen their brand, and understand what’s coming next.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Built for More brings three powerhouse speakers to one stage for an afternoon designed to raise the bar for entrepreneurs in the Okanagan... covering AI, branding, visibility, and what it really takes to scale successfully.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This is a chance to learn directly from people who have done it, from international stages, to NETFLIX, these leaders are still doing it, and are willing to share the experience, strategy, lessons, and perspective behind their success.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\">ON STAGE</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">KARIN BOHN</span> - Founder of House of Bohn, award-winning entrepreneur and interior designer, NETFLIX star of Restaurants on the Edge<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Karin has built an internationally recognized interior design firm, and a career spanning across business, media and television. She’ll pull back the curtain on what it really takes to scale a business... the hard decisions, growing pains, and lessons learned along the way, while sharing the secret on how she continues to evolve through every new chapter.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">ROCKY OZAKI</span> - Founder & CEO of the NoW of Work, AI Specialist, 3x Tech Founder<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>AI is changing how we work, market, communicate and grow... quickly. Rocky who has coached individuals across North America on the power of AI, will bring it down to earth and show entrepreneurs how to understand the shift, where the opportunities are, and how AI can actually be used within your business without getting lost in the noise.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">LEANNE CALDERWOOD</span> - Founder, personal branding and visibility expert.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Being great at what you do is only part of the equation. Leanne is an expert in personal branding, visibility and building brand awareness, and she’ll show you how to become known for what you do. Expect practical insight around positioning, visibility, personal brand, and how to build the kind of presence that makes people remember you, trust you, and think of you when opportunities arise.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>INCLUDED WITH YOUR TICKET<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Every Built for More attendee will receive a complimentary hardcover copy of The Boss Method: Guided 90 Days of Focus, Action & Results. (Value $45)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Created to help turn ideas into action, this 90-day planner will guide you through your goals, milestones, weekly priorities, accountability and progress, giving you a tool to carry the momentum from Built for More into the weeks that follow.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>ONE MORE THING…<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This afternoon will also include the reveal of something completely new — something designed to change the way our business community connects, supports one another and grows together.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Get ready, Okanagan... something HUGE is coming, our community is leading the way, and you’re all going to be part of it!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>TITLE SPONSOR - TD Women in Enterprise<span><br/></span>GOLD SPONSOR - Body Bar Kelowna<span><br/></span>STAGE SPONSOR - Marshall's Home Living<span><br/></span>SPONSOR - Atlas Rose<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $169.46</span>  ($145.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $22.10 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre at the Rotary Centre for the Arts event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. Tickets for <span class=\"BoldText\">Built For More</span> are refundable up to 30 days prior to event date, minus fees. Ticket fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
