<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/408601AHDKHQTVGMTKKQSRTQCBSMPGSDQ>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "College for Arts and Technology Grad '26";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/736eebb9-5487-4f10-9c9c-b06c991f03b4.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>College for Arts and Technology presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">2026 GRADUATION CEREMONY</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>We are thrilled to celebrate the remarkable achievements of our 2026 graduating class. This momentous occasion marks the culmination of years of hard work, dedication and perseverance. Join us in commemorating this milestone, as we applaud the graduates for their outstanding accomplishments and look forward to the impact they will make in the world! Congratulations, Class of 2026!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular $20.00</span> ($15.01 base price + $2.36 CIF + $2.63 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">College for Arts and Technology Grad '26</span> tickets are non-refundable.</span>
""";
