  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Creatures of the Night";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/4f4cf148-20f5-4133-b400-9155278773d5.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Bat Education Ecological Protection Society presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">CREATURES OF THE NIGHT AERIAL ACROBATICS FUNDRAISER FOR BEEPS</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>The 3rd Annual Creatures of the Night Aerial Acrobatics Fundraiser for BEEPS will showcase performers from the Vale Aerial Arts (Formally Peak Aerial Fitness). Performers will showcase their amazing aerial skills on aerial Silks, Hoop, Hammock and Pole in unique spooky, silly and dramatic routines. Proceeds from this event will go towards BEEPS for their bat conservation and education programs based out of Peachland.  <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Early bird  $35.00</span>  ($31.82 base price + $3.18 service charge)<span><br/></span>(<span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Early bird rate from Aug. 24 - Oct. 8</span></span>)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $45.00</span>  ($41.82 base price + $4.18 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. Ticket service fees for <span class=\"BoldText\">Creatures of the Night</span> are non-refundable. </span>
""";
