<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/398201AQMNTLSBCTKHVVPHGQSMSVTCJGG>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Delphine's Holiday Songbook";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/87cbb53a-8c32-4cf9-955a-a1db02c94e99.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Delphinium Productions presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">DELPHINE'S HOLIDAY SONGBOOK</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">featuring special guest Spencer Bach, piano</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Step away from the holiday rush and join Kelowna vocalist Delphine Litke, with special guest Spencer Bach on piano, for an enchanting evening of Christmas songs and stories. Featuring cherished classics, contemporary festive favourites, and a sprinkle of musical mischief, this all-ages evening promises warm memories, joyful laughter, and the spirit of the season shared through music.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">General  $35.00</span>  ($31.82 base price + $3.18 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Delphine's Holiday Songbook</span> tickets and service fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
