<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/410801AHRRCDVQSTTTNTHKGGNRDBVGVHG>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Electric Elton";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Moon Coin Productions presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">ELECTRIC ELTON</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Elton John fans, don’t miss “Electric Elton — An Unforgettable Live Concert Experience returning to Kelowna Community Theatre on March 19, 2027 @ 7 pm!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Get ready for an unforgettable night of music, nostalgia and world-class entertainment as <span class=\"BoldText\">Electric Elton</span> celebrates the songs, spectacle and enduring legacy of one of the greatest performers in rock history.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Led by acclaimed vocalist and pianist <span class=\"BoldText\">Sean Trombley</span>, <span class=\"ItalicText\">Electric Elton</span> is a dazzling live concert experience that captures the energy, spirit and musical brilliance of Elton John during his legendary 1970s era. With remarkable vocals, exceptional musicianship and electric stage presence, Sean delivers an authentic tribute that honours the artistry and excitement of Elton's most iconic performances while creating a thrilling concert experience for all ages.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Backed by a sensational live band, colourful costumes, dynamic dancers and stunning multimedia, <span class=\"ItalicText\">Electric Elton</span> recreates the excitement of Elton John's classic concerts with the perfect blend of musical precision and theatrical spectacle. Every element has been carefully crafted to transport audiences back in time when Elton John dominated the charts with unforgettable songs that have become the soundtrack of generations.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Audiences will enjoy beloved classics including <span class=\"BoldText\">Rocket Man, Tiny Dancer, Your Song, Bennie and the Jets, Crocodile Rock, Goodbye Yellow Brick Road, Saturday Night's Alright for Fighting,</span> and many more. From heartfelt ballads to high-energy anthems, every performance is a celebration of the songs that continue to inspire fans around the world.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Sean's connection to Elton's music began in childhood when he taught himself to play <span class=\"ItalicText\">Crocodile Rock</span> on the piano. That lifelong passion shines through in every note, bringing warmth, authenticity and genuine respect to this spectacular music. Whether recreating Elton's soaring vocals, commanding the piano or engaging audiences with infectious energy, Sean captures both the emotional depth and joyful spirit that made Elton John one of music's most iconic entertainers.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The result is more than a tribute concert—it's an immersive celebration that invites audiences to sing along, reminisce and experience the excitement of Elton John's timeless music together. Longtime fans will rediscover the songs they grew up with, while new generations will experience the unforgettable magic of one of pop music's greatest catalogues performed live on stage.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Audiences across North America have embraced Electric Elton with standing ovations and enthusiastic praise:<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>🌟<span class=\"BoldText\">\"OUTSTANDING!!! This gentleman should have played Elton John in the movie!\"</span><span><br/></span>— Bob McKay, Maple Ridge, BC<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>🌟<span class=\"BoldText\">\"Wow... soooo much like Elton's voice!! It's uncanny!\"</span><span><br/></span>— Jamie Boratynec, Surrey, BC<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>🌟<span class=\"BoldText\">Phenomenal show! Hope you come back.”</span> <span><br/></span>- John Wirts – Bellingham, WA<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Come for the timeless songs. Stay for the spectacular production. Leave with a smile as <span class=\"ItalicText\">Electric Elton</span> delivers a joyful, high-energy celebration of the music and legacy of Elton John that audiences won't soon forget. <span class=\"BoldText\">Groups of 10 or more get 10% off.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Check out a sneak peek!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>YouTube Link: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://youtu.be/a37ArXkKOJU?si=15sqyWs-VP4m_KDW\">https://youtu.be/a37ArXkKOJU?si=15sqyWs-VP4m_KDW</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>🎟️ Tickets are on sale now! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>iLoveEltonJohn.com<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Follow us on Facebook & Instagram<span><br/></span>@TributeToEltonJohn<span><br/></span>
""";
