<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/411801ADLSSGTVKGHRLGJSRLPNGPGQRKH>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Fire & Ice";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/fd23775b-243b-4f29-89ba-b43dc830438f.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Blue Willow Entertainment presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">FIRE & ICE</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">A Community Benefit Concert in Support of Mamas for Mamas</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>When our neighbours need us, we rally.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Blue Willow Entertainment presents Fire & Ice</span>, a special evening of live music bringing the Kelowna community together in support of <span class=\"BoldText\">Mamas for Mamas</span> and families impacted by wildfires across the region.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join us at the <span class=\"BoldText\">Kelowna Rotary Centre for the Arts</span> for an incredible night of live music featuring:<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Jeff Piattelli</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Ayla Jean & Friends</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Freeze the Fall</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets are Pay What You Feel</span>, giving everyone the opportunity to be part of the evening while contributing what they can to support the cause.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>We’re proud to support <span class=\"BoldText\">Mamas for Mamas, Blue Willow Entertainment, Sopa Fine Arts, and the Rotary Centre for the Arts</span> with the <span class=\"BoldText\">Fire & Ice</span> Fundraiser this Sunday, August 30th, 2026.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Many families displaced by the wildfires have lost everything — including their <span class=\"BoldText\">children’s clothing, shoes, toys, and school supplies.</span> With school starting in just a few weeks, there is an urgent need to help these kids feel safe, supported, and ready for a fresh start.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>We’re collecting <span class=\"BoldText\">new and gently used children’s clothing, shoes, toys, and school supplies</span> to help families in our community.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>📍 <span class=\"BoldText\">Rotary Centre for the Arts</span><span><br/></span>🕓 <span class=\"BoldText\">Donations accepted from 4:00 p.m. on Sunday, August 30th</span><span><br/></span>🎨 <span class=\"BoldText\">Sponsored by SOPA Fine Arts</span><span><br/></span>🎟️ <span class=\"BoldText\">Pay What You Wish</span><span><br/></span>🎶 <span class=\"BoldText\">Concert begins at 6:30 p.m.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Every donation can make a difference for a child who has already been through so much.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">If you can donate, please come by and help us support Okanagan families in need.</span> ❤️<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pay What You Wish Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$14.99</span>  ($10.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $2.63 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$19.99</span>  ($15.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $2.63 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$25.71</span>  ($20.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $3.35 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$31.46</span>  ($25.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $4.10 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$37.21</span>  ($30.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $4.85 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$42.96</span>  ($35.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $5.60 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$48.71</span>  ($40.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $6.35 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Fire & Ice</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
