<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/356601ATRBGSBJTPJQPLRMDQHHLDDCGHK>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Hyprov: Improv Under Hypnosis Comedy Show";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/a67652e5-03ff-4b04-8a5a-7ed62cd8126a.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>MPRO4 Entertainment presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">HYPROV:</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Improv Under Hypnosis Comedy Show</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Important Update: Postponed to March 25, 2027</h2><span class=\"BoldText\">Given the current state of emergency in our region, MPRO4 Entertainment has made the decision to postpone the upcoming HYPROV performances in Kelowna and Kamloops.</span> At this time, we believe it's most important for our community to focus on the safety and well-being of their families and neighbours, and we want to do our part by giving everyone the space to do just that.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With this change in date, we are pleased to share that the celebrity improvisor joining this tour will be the incomparable Colin Mochrie, known for his work on Whose Line Is It Anyway?<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>We sincerely appreciate your understanding and continued support during this time.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span>An international success story, HYPROV (pronounced hip-rawv) continues to make waves after its sold out Canadian tour in 2024, and Off-Broadway run in 2022. This live show, which has been called a “celebration of the human imagination” by The Times of London, combines hypnosis and improv for a one-of-a-kind comedy experience. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The 90-minute show combines hypnosis and improv–two art forms that have mystified and entertained fans, skeptics and everyone in between worldwide–for a totally unique comedy experience. The evening begins with world-renowned hypnotist, Asad Mecci welcoming 20 volunteers on stage to be hypnotized. The most receptive to hypnosis then join a celebrity improv comedian to improvise the rest of the show, while hypnotized. In the hands of two experts–and solely crafted from the volunteers' uninhibited, unconscious minds–each show is an entirely original and completely unforgettable theatrical experience.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 1  $77.11</span>  ($65.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $9.75 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 2  $65.61</span>  ($55.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.25 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">HYPROV</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2027-03-25T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/a67652e5-03ff-4b04-8a5a-7ed62cd8126a.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/location/201AGBHDRLQHNHPHKKMPKLGPMDRDTDMVL>;
  schema:organizer <https://spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/organization/mpro4-entertainment>;
