<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/412001AVDDBCHBNLTGRRLVKCKLBKVSSKK>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Johnny Reid and band Live";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/04ef1622-d629-4312-b5be-c7061cc663f9.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Kootenay Concert Connection presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">JOHNNY REID AND BAND LIVE</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Over an illustrious career spanning three decades, JUNO Award-winning singer-songwriter Johnny Reid has captured the hearts of fans and audiences around the world. The critically acclaimed singer is widely known for his lyrical honesty and musical ability, as demonstrated by an extensive catalogue of hit songs, album sales totaling over 2 million units worldwide, countless awards and multiple sold-out national arena tours. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $100.11</span>  ($85.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $12.75 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Johnny Reid and band Live</span> tickets and fees are non-refundable.</span><span><br/></span>
""";
