<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/411401AQPGJQBHVKVKKMKBPBBHTKDTCNC>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Objects in Motion - Encore";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/05ceb2ab-193b-4692-bd34-a5c387476a84.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Inner Fish Theatre Society presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">OBJECTS IN MOTION - ENCORE!</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">& First look at Living Things Festival 2027</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Open doors at 6:30PM.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">For mature audiences.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Objects in Motion, a Living Things Festival favourite since 2017, is an annual selection of international short animated films curated by local artist, professor, and animator Myron Campbell. These films push the boundaries of storytelling and animation through innovative formal exploration. Whether showcasing hand-drawn works, stop-motion with physical objects, or digitally created puppetry, Objects in Motion is always a diverse, unexpected and emotionally impactful selection — from hilarity to pointed social critique — taking us to places we really didn’t think it was possible to go….<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Why “Encore”? This special screening revisits the January 2026 edition of Objects in Motion. We loved it and heard great reviews from festival audiences, so we're bringing it back.  We’ve added another film—a surprise for returning viewers and an added delight for everyone. Don’t miss this chance to experience these unique films in a comfortable chair with great acoustics, cinema quality visuals, and the best company in town.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Before the screening begins, we will give you a first look at the Living Things 2027 Festival lineup—our 11th edition! Be the first to discover the incredible performances coming to Kelowna in January. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Presented by Inner Fish Performance, a Kelowna based non-profit artistic organization.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2>INCLUSIVE PRICING<span><br/></span>In a spirit of openness and accessibility, we invite everyone to choose the ticket price that best suits their situation.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Supporter</span> <span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I would like to support inclusive pricing and help make lower-priced tickets available to others.</span>  <span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$42.96</span>  ($35.00 base price + $2.36 CIF  + $5.60 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I would like to support arts and culture in Kelowna and am able to pay the full price of a ticket.</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$31.46</span>  ($25.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $4.10 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Student</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I am a student and would like to enjoy arts and culture at an affordable price.</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$19.99</span>  ($15.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $2.63 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Reduced Rate</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I have a limited budget for cultural activities but don't want to miss out.</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$14.99</span>  ($10.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $2.63 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre at the Rotary Centre for the Arts event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Objects in Motion - Encore</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
