  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "OSO - Chocolate Tasting Add-On (Penticton)";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/14414235-99d4-494a-80e4-f72bdd163849.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h1>Chocolats Symphonique</h1><h2>An add-on experience to accompany Music That Shimmers</h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table> <span><br/></span>Add the 4-piece chocolate tasting and treat your ears <span class=\"ItalicText\">and</span> your taste buds. Savour four specially selected chocolates as their matching movements of Maxime Goulet’s Symphonic Chocolates unfold live on stage. Four flavours, four musical moments, one deliciously memorable experience. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Warning: may cause spontaneous smiling.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2>$12.00 + $0.60 fee = $12.60 total price
""";
