			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/0b269b43-ed59-4a6a-8149-1144bbeee136.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Okanagan Symphony Orchestra presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">FREYA & FRIENDS</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">featuring Freya, Jazz vocalist Leila Naderi, and the Okanagan Symphony Chorus</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>An undisputed hit in 2025, folk duo Freya returns with music that will touch your heart and soul. <span class=\"BoldText\">Freya & Friends</span> expands their signature warmth, welcoming Okanagan-based jazz vocalist Leila Naderi, weaving new songs and reimagining favorites. The Okanagan Symphony Chorus joins the Orchestra for a holiday concert that renews the magic while charting new ground for the season.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>--
<span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span class=\"BoldText\">Section A</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adult</span> $75.00 base price + $11.25 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$86.25</span> total price<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Senior</span> $56.25 base price + $8.44 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$64.69</span> total price<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Section B</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adult</span> $63.75 base price + $9.56 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$73.31</span> total price<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Senior</span> $45.00 base price + $6.75 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$51.75</span> total price<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Youth</span> $18.00 base price + $2.70 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$20.70</span> total price<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Section C</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adult</span> $37.50 base price + $5.63 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$43.13</span> total price<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Senior</span> $37.50 base price + $5.63 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$43.13</span> total price<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Youth</span> $18.00 base price + $2.70 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$20.70</span> total price<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Senior - age 65yrs+, Youth - up to age 24yrs.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. Okanagan Symphony Orchestra <span class=\"BoldText\">Freya & Friends</span> tickets and applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
