<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/409601AJHLJGJBKPJMVTTQDJPBCGTJSBJ>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "PRISM - Canadian Rock Legends";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/cdbb2662-4565-4ff1-a00a-738521530a7f.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Scotty Dog Entertainment presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">PRISM</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Canadian Rock Legends</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>PRISM ~ CANADIAN ROCK LEGENDS : inducted into Canada’s Walk of Fame, Prism is a national treasure, also at the top of the charts on Mars:  NASA chose “Spaceship Superstar” as the official song aboard  Space Shuttle Discovery during its historic final flight, which speaks to Prism’s ongoing popularity, even in outer space! Meanwhile, back on earth.<span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>They have sold millions of albums and recorded songs that have become classic rock standards, including “Take Me to the Kaptin,” “Armageddon,” “Flyin’,” “Take Me Away,” “Young & Restless,” “Night to Remember,” and “Don’t Let Him Know.” Simply put, Prism is classic rock.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Collecting Juno Awards for Album & Group of the Year, platinum albums and ongoing sold-out shows, Prism is a must-see live attraction. The band rocks the hits more energetically than ever, thrilling <span><br/></span>audiences nationwide.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Founding member Al Harlow’s showmanship drives Prism forward with award-winning alumni Gary Grace, Greg Cox, and Marc Gladstone’s trademark performances of the Prism sound. Every day across the <span><br/></span>country, radio is playing Prism classics!!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 1  $95.95</span>  ($81.38 base price + $2.36 CIF + $12.21 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 2  $89.95</span>  ($76.17 base price + $2.36 CIF + $11.42 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 3  $74.95</span>  ($63.12 base price + $2.36 CIF + $9.47 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 4  $69.95</span>  ($58.77 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.82 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">PRISM</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
