<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/407401ALVBSTVMBHGLLBKVVKPPPKRKKMQ>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Reel Okanagan - Roslyn Frantz: LIVE";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/422ed9c6-3e35-4b12-aec9-afe568496d70.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Reel Okanagan Film Festival presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">ROSLYN FRANTZ: LIVE</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Directed by local filmmaker Sandy Hoekstra, <span class=\"ItalicText\">Roslyn Frantz: LIVE</span> is an award-winning documentary funded through the TELUS STORYHIVE program. The film celebrates the life, artistry, and enduring impact of Roslyn Frantz, a beloved Okanagan arts community leader whose passion for creativity, performance, and community building has inspired generations. A fitting finale to Reel Okanagan, this film shines a spotlight on one of the individuals who helped shape the region's vibrant cultural landscape.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $16.51</span>  ($12.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $2.15 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre at the Rotary Centre for the Arts event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Roslyn Frantz: LIVE</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
