<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/393801AVTSHRDBDPJLDBBVRMQQCHBPHPQ>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Snowbird Concert Series";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/dfcece3a-d307-4c92-9914-c9c07dacc853.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Medipac and the CSA presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">SNOWBIRD CONCERT SERIES</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Join us for a FREE concert to celebrate the snowbird lifestyle, with performances by singer-songwriter Carolyn Dawn Johnson, comedian Bruce McCulloch, and fiddler Ashley MacIsaac! This event includes a special presentation by Canadian Snowbird Association President Garry McDonald, who will talk about what you need to know when travelling outside Canada. Sponsored by Medipac Travel Insurance and The Canadian Snowbird Association.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">This is a free event, pre-registration is required.</span></span>
""";
