<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/406001ABMGKMQJGPSHSGNSLRBKKKKLVTV>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Su Terra Familiare film screening";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/8d11ae80-6bb6-456e-9964-2941bc4eda4e.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Kelowna Canadian Italian Club presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">SU TERRA FAMILIARE (On Familiar Ground)</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">film screening</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>An original documentary highlighting the history of Kelowna's Italians and the creation of cultural clubs to give Italians a place that feels familiar (Su Terra Familiare is \"On Familiar Ground\"?). Touching and heartfelt, it documents the immigrant experience in the B.C. Interior, from the late 1800s to the present day. This documentary debuted in June and has been brought back by popular demand.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $19.69</span>  ($14.70 base price + $2.36 CIF + $2.63 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre at the Rotary Centre for the Arts event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Su Terra Familiare</span> ticket fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
