<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/399401AGHHKGJVPPBQRQNPLSTKQPSPVRL>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Princess Proms Concert";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/d7063b35-42ea-4494-9c26-62ef5fe9a6ae.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>EV Productions presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">THE PRINCESS PROMS CONCERT</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>We invite you to an enchanting concert, singing the most magical music in all of the land.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Prepare for a show stopping performance as we pay tribute to the iconic, heartwarming and nostalgic songs from animations including; Frozen, Wicked, K-Pop Demon Hunters, Moana, The Wizard of Oz, Beauty & The Beast, Anastasia, Pocahontas, Aladdin, The Little Mermaid, The Lion King, Willy Wonka & the Chocolate Factory and more! As well as a few from our favourite popstars like Taylor Swift, Coldplay and Rachel Platte.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With an incredible response and sold-out shows across the country, we know this show will stay in your hearts forever. Creating magical memories, sharing stunning musical moments, and spreading joy is at the very heart of what we do.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The stars of our show have performed on the West End, ITV, for Royalty, and more, but their dreams have truly come true touring this concert and performing for you.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>We’re absolutely enchanted to have you join us. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Performing the magical music of:<span><br/></span>Frozen • Wicked • K-Pop Demon Hunters<span><br/></span>Moana • Taylor Swift • Wizard of Oz<span><br/></span>Beauty & the Beast • Aladdin<span><br/></span>Anastasia • Pocahontas<span><br/></span>+ MANY MORE<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Under-2's do not require a seat if sat on a parent or guardian's lap throughout the show.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\">Please note 16-year-olds or over must purchase an adult ticket.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Disclaimer: The Enchanted Voices and its events are not affiliated with the films, composers or rights holders listed. All trademarks are the property of their respective owners.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 1  Adult  $103.79</span>  ($88.20 base price + $2.36 CIF + $13.23 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 1  Child  $94.13</span>  ($79.80 base price + $2.36 CIF  + $11.97 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 2  Adult  $88.09</span>  ($74.55 base price + $2.36 CIF + $11.18 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 2  Child  $78.43</span>  ($66.15 base price + $2.36 CIF + $9.92 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 3  Adult  $71.19</span>  ($59.85 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.98 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 3  Child  $62.74</span>  ($52.50 base price + $2.36 CIF + $7.88 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 4  Adult  $55.49</span>  ($46.20 base price + $2.36 CIF + $6.93 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 4  Child  $47.04</span>  ($38.85 base price + $2.36 CIF + $5.83 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">The Princess Proms Concert</span> tickets and service fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
