<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/400801AHPDHDSVVHMJCHKKQRLMRBRPPKM>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Sweet Caroline Tour: A Tribute to Neil Diamond";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/961de91f-c82b-45e1-8b59-a89413339d33.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Johnny Showtime Ltd. presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">SWEET CAROLINE -</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">A Tribute to Neil Diamond</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">The Sweet Caroline Tour: A Tribute to Neil Diamond</span> is a celebration of one of the most enduring songbooks in popular music history - an era when songs were written with heart, soul and honesty, and melodies stayed with you for a lifetime. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This outstanding live production recreates that feeling in the most authentic way possible, with a full live band, powerful backing vocalists and a frontman whose voice and presence capture the unmistakable spirit of Neil Diamond. From iconic stadium anthems to deeply loved classics, every performance is delivered with energy, respect and a deep love for the music. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Hear all the timeless hits: Sweet Caroline, Song Sung Blue, Red Red Wine, Cracklin’ Rosie, Forever in Blue Jeans, Cherry Cherry, Crunchy Granola Suite, Shilo, Solitary Man, Kentucky Woman, I Am… I Said, Holly Holy, Soolaimon and more. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Sing along, relive the magic and remember what great live music truly sounds like.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mgHqaXp1J6E\">Check out the show trailer here!</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adult  $79.00</span>  ($66.64 base price + $2.36 CIF + $10.00 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Senior  $69.00</span>  ($57.95 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.69 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">The Sweet Caroline Tour - A Tribute to Neil Diamond</span> tickets and service fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
