	</table><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The University of British Columbia - Okanagan Heat Men's & Women's Volleyball teams take on the UFV Cascades in a doubleheader match.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2><span class=\"BoldText\">Women's Gametime</span> - 4:00 pm</h2><h2><span class=\"BoldText\">Men's Gametime</span> - 6:00 pm</h2><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Notes:</span><span><br/></span><ul><li>UBC Okanagan Varsity Athletics events are general admission seating.</li><li>On-site tickets go on sale 60 minutes prior to the start of each event.</li><li>Prices for individual game tickets include both the women's and men's game on the same night.</li></ul><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Event Parking:</span><span><br/></span>For Heat varsity events on Friday, Saturday and Sunday:<span><br/></span><ul><li>Heat event parking will be available from August 27, 2026 until April 30, 2027.</li><li>$3 event parking is available Fridays starting at 4 pm, and on Saturdays and Sundays at 12:30 pm</li><li>Event parking rate is available in <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://parking.ok.ubc.ca/find-parking/\">lots S, G and B</a> on the HonkMobile app or <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.honkmobile.com/\">Honkmobile.com</a>. This rate is not available on the pay stations.</li><li>Starting Aug. 27, a $0.45 transaction fee will be charged by HonkMobile on all transactions.</li></ul><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><table class=\" BorderOn\">
