  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "United Way Show & Shine Fundraiser";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/181608ce-75f6-4130-a56e-3d0363f67908.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Infrastructure Division - City of Kelowna presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">UNITED WAY SHOW & SHINE FUNDRAISER 2026</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Join us for a fun lunch-hour event in support of the United Way!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">City Yards Office<span><br/></span>1495 Hardy, St., Kelowna, BC<span><br/></span>11:00am-1:00pm</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Come down to City Yards Office on Wednesday, September 23th from 11:00 AM – 1:00 PM and enjoy a classic BBQ while checking out a lineup of unique and eye-catching vehicles at our Show & Shine.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>For a minimum $10 donation, you’ll receive a delicious burger, refreshing pop, and a tasty side—all while helping raise funds for the United Way and the vital programs they support in our community.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Bring your appetite, bring your coworkers, and support a great cause!
""";
