<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/410601AKMPMGTCCLHVHSBLGPQJTDHLKPT>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Vancouver International Mountain Film Festival";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/599e175d-bc9b-4f64-84a3-38044f33d4b6.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Elevation Outdoors presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">VANCOUVER INTERNATIONAL MOUNTAIN FILM FESTIVAL</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Witness the magic of the mountains on the big screen as the Vancouver International Mountain Film Festival (VIMFF) returns to Kelowna on October 23 for an inspiring evening of adventure, storytelling, and epic mountain films.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Each year the VIMFF tours the world with a selection of the year’s best mountain films. The Kelowna screening brings a handpicked lineup of the most inspiring and visually stunning mountain films to the big screen at Kelowna Community Theatre.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The evening begins at 6:00 PM with live music, community booths, and a door prize draw. At 7:00 PM, the film program starts, featuring an exciting speaker presentation.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Proceeds from the event will support Elevation Outdoors, a Kelowna-based charity that empowers youth facing barriers by providing access to outdoor sports, mentorship, and life skills coaching programs.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join us for a powerful night of mountain films and help make a difference for youth in our community!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $40.00</span>  ($32.73 base price + $2.36 CIF + $4.91 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Vancouver International Mountain Film Festival</span> tickets and service fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-10-23T19:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/599e175d-bc9b-4f64-84a3-38044f33d4b6.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/location/201AGBHDRLQHNHPHKKMPKLGPMDRDTDMVL>;
