  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Wilder Voices";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/7a4ccd3f-2c19-4377-9e37-8785f084273f.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>The Wilder Institute presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">WILDER VOICES</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>The future of the wild is being written right now.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join the Wilder Institute for an inspiring evening of conversation, storytelling, and conservation at the Wilder Voices Speaker Series.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This special event brings together two passionate voices for wildlife and the natural world. Renowned naturalist and conservation advocate Brian Keating joins Dr. Gráinne McCabe, conservation scientist and Chief Conservation Officer at the Wilder Institute, for an engaging discussion on the challenges and opportunities facing wildlife today and how each of us can help create a one wild future.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Designed to foster meaningful community engagement, Wilder Voices offers an inspiring and educational experience that connects you to the heart of our mission and the collective effort required to create lasting change for wildlife and people.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Help us build one wild future — a future where wildlife and people thrive, together.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adult  $31.46</span>  ($25.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $4.10 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Student w/ID  $25.71</span>  ($20.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $3.35 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre at the Rotary Centre for the Arts event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. Applicable ticket fees for <span class=\"BoldText\">Wilder Voices</span> are non-refundable.</span>
""";
